      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Three sites in Fremont—Aycock Birthplace, Barnes‑Hooks Farm, and the Dred and Ellen Yelverton House—are listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
